<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11> <https://schema.org/text> "( 1 ) For the purpose of enabling it to exercise its powers and perform its functions, the Board may appoint such committees as it thinks necessary or desirable."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
