<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee established under subsection (1) shall deliberate upon matters referred to it by the Board and make appropriate recommendations thereon to the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
