<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to this Act, and to any direction given by the Board, a committee established under subsection (1) may determine its own procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
