<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "A committee established under subsection (1) shall conform to any direction or instruction given to it from time to time by the Board and the Board may, at any time, discontinue, or alter the constitution of, the committee so appointed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
