<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of the First Schedule, except paragraph 7, shall apply to a committee established under subsection (1) as they apply to the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
