<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "The Deputy Rector nominated under subsection (9) shall act during any period that the post of Rector is vacant. Registrar"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
