<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "There shall be a Rector of the Akademi who shall be appointed by the Minister."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, at any time, revoke the appointment of the Rector without assigning any reason therefor."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_IV__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
