<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "It is hereby declared that any property, whether movable or immovable, which, immediately before the appointed date, was used for the purposes which after that date become the purposes of the Akademi established by this Act shall, on that date, be vested in the Akademi. Existing contracts"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_47> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
