<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51> <https://schema.org/text> "All persons who immediately before the appointed date were students of the Akademi Seni Kebangsaan shall, on that date, be deemed to be students of the Akademi. Pending disciplinary proceedings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_52> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
