<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Service of any notice under this Act or any subsidiary legislation made thereunder shall be effected by registered post to the person affected thereby and shall be deemed to have been served on the day succeeding the day on which the notice would have been delivered in the ordinary course of post."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
