<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_30__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Every such supplementary estimate shall be considered and sanctioned by the Board, and submitted to the Minister, who shall deal with it as if it were an original annual estimate."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_30__subsec_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_30> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
