<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_30__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "A supplementary estimate prepared under this section shall show the sources from which the additional expenditure shown in the supplementary estimate is to be met."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
