<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Rector may delegate any of his disciplinary powers, duties or functions to the Deputy Rector or any member of the staff, in respect of any particular student, or any class or category of students of the Akademi."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
