<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Deputy Rector or the member of the staff to whom disciplinary powers, duties or functions under subsection (3) have been delegated shall exercise, discharge or perform them under the direction and control of the Rector who shall have the power to review, rescind or vary any decision or finding of the Deputy Rector or such member of the staff."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
