<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~part_V__cl_24__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "where any books, accounts, writings, lists of members, seals, banners or insignia of, or relating to, or purporting to relate to, any organization, body or group of persons are found in the possession, custody or under the control of any person, it shall be presumed, until the contrary is proved, that such person is a member of such organization, body or group and such organization, body or group shall be presumed, until the contrary is proved, to be in existence at the time such books, accounts, writings, lists of members, seals, banners or insignia are so found; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
