<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~sched_2__para_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The SRC shall hold meetings from time to time as it may deem necessary and it shall be the duty of the Secretary to keep minutes of every meeting of the SRC and such minutes shall be confirmed at a subsequent meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
