<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~sched_2__para_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Every meeting of the SRC or of an ad hoc committee of the SRC shall be held only at a place provided for the purpose of such meetings by the Rector."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
