<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@/~sched_2__para_10__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Rector or his representative shall be present at each meeting of the SRC or of an ad hoc committee of the SRC, unless the Rector decides otherwise in respect of any particular meeting. Inspection of records"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/3/eng@> .
